From b236dccd15f8a92ea3e2348bbb06ffc35fd456bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:32:51 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18g: route extension tabs and logical shell
 windows

Expose host-reported extension window membership, active tab and focus, and bounded host creation/activation requests. Route registry tabs through tabs query/get/update/remove and read-only windows APIs with Chromium permission scrubbing; options and single-URL normal windows use the host instead of stock Browser creation. Removal joins the veto-aware tab close pipeline. ABI 1.36 / bridge 0.38.0 (extension_windows); build p89 and local MV3 routing fixture pass with no outside connections. Geometry, multi-URL windows, tab groups/move and windows mutations remain unsupported.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
